# 仅允许开发用户通过公钥登录，禁止密码和 root 登录。
Port 22
AddressFamily any
ListenAddress 0.0.0.0
ListenAddress ::
HostKey /var/lib/sshd-hostkeys/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PubkeyAuthentication yes
AuthenticationMethods publickey
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PermitRootLogin no
AllowUsers developer
AuthorizedKeysFile .ssh/authorized_keys
StrictModes yes
AllowTcpForwarding yes
X11Forwarding no
PermitTunnel no
UsePAM no
PrintMotd no
LogLevel VERBOSE
